{"reviewId": "17139892_81AHfgPZS", "review": {"abstract": "我们现在谈论城市化，实际上与我们未来的产业选择有极大的关联性。因为我们把城市化作为本次经济起飞的原动力，所以，未来产业多样化过程中的主导产业将会沿着城市化的线索展开，对这一点，国际经验早有证明", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "工业化带来就业，吸引人进城，推动城市化；\n城市化提供人口、市场和资源，又反过来支持工业化。\n如果两者协调得好，经济就会快速发展；\n如果其中一个滞后，比如城市化跟不上工业化，就会出现交通拥堵、住房紧张、环境问题等；如果工业化滞后，城市发展就缺乏产业支撑，容易出现“空心化”。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "7701-7797", "createTime": 1752326887, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "17139892_81AHfgPZS", "userVid": 17139892, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 17139892, "name": "🐳空白", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/hNWCQ9bibbzGwmx2pVUianIED6Zwibk51yk6F5N1gN0OWnvtnYGOaQgEta6yGveVxhVyLarFrjCg4w/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "🐳空白", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 6, "likes": [{"userVid": 17139892, "name": "🐳空白", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/hNWCQ9bibbzGwmx2pVUianIED6Zwibk51yk6F5N1gN0OWnvtnYGOaQgEta6yGveVxhVyLarFrjCg4w/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "🐳空白", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "房地产行业就此进入高速增长阶段。", "reviewId": "17139892_81AHfgPZS", "commentId": "17139892_81AHf